    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding what? there's nothing left to build on. the people i knew, the respect i earned... it was all tied to that version of me. that person is dead. now i'm just a joke people whisper about. how am i supposed to just 'start over' when the world has already decided who i am? it feels like there's no way back from this.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
