      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right that the old version is gone—but that doesn't mean you're finished. The world's whispers are just noise; they don't get to write your ending. Starting over isn't about reclaiming what was, it's about discovering what's next, even if it's small and quiet at first. You're not a joke—you're a story still being written, and you get to hold the pen.",
